<html lang='en' style='margin:0; padding:0;'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1' />
    <title>Ground Support Platform Access Update</title>
    <style>
      /* Reset and base */ body, html { margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color:
      #f7f9fc; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333;
      -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; } .container {
      max-width: 600px; background: #fff; margin: 20px auto; border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); padding: 24px 32px; } h1 { color:
      #1a73e8; font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 16px; text-align: center; } p {
      font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 12px 0; } .btn { display:
      inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; margin: 12px 8px 24px 8px; font-size:
      16px; color: #fff; background-color: #1a73e8; text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; cursor:
      pointer; transition: background-color 0.3s ease; } .btn:hover {
      background-color: #155ab6; } .btn.cancel { background-color: #e53935; }
      .btn.cancel:hover { background-color: #b42b24; } .btn-container {
      text-align: center; } .footer { font-size: 14px; color: #888; text-align:
      center; margin-top: 32px; line-height: 1.4; } /* Responsive */ @media only
      screen and (max-width: 640px) { .container { margin: 12px 16px; padding:
      20px; } h1 { font-size: 20px; } p { font-size: 15px; } .btn { display:
      block; width: 80%; margin: 12px auto; } }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='container'>
      <h1>Ground Support Platform Access Update</h1>
      <p>Hello <strong>{{username}}</strong>,</p>
      <p>We wanted to inform you that your invitation to the Ground Support
        Platform has been revoked.</p>
      <p>If this action was not expected or if you believe this was a mistake,
        please contact support immediately.</p>
      <p>However, you still have the option to join the platform by using the
        link below:</p>

      <div class='btn-container'>
        <a
          href='{{baseUrl}}/?email={{email}}'
          class='btn'
          target='_blank'
          rel='noopener'
        >Join as Technician or Operator</a>

      </div>

      <p>Note: Upon successful registration as a user, our system will
        automatically send your details to our innovation team for further
        collaboration.</p>

      <div class='footer'>
        Thank you,<br />
        The Ground Support Team
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>